{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年79歲的殿堂級藝人汪明荃（阿姐），近日北上佛山南海舉行音樂會。</p><p>有別於慣常的大型體育館個唱，今次演出移師酒店宴會廳以「晚宴騷」形式進行。</p><p>相關片段在網上曝光後，一度惹來部分網民質疑阿姐「自降身價」，隨即引來大批忠實歌迷留言平反。</p><p>&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:18:08.939946+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T11:01:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T11:11:31.518586+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T11:11:31.518586+00:00","content_hash":"891c9c22c9bf8d1285c34299078028a36b8590720deca561680693428fad0e63","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}